  "ingredients": [
    "4 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "4 large egg",
    "3/4 cup almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened almond milk"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add all ingredients to a blender, then pulse until smooth and well combined. Let rest for a few minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a non-stick pan over medium-low heat, spray just enough cooking spray to cover the bottom of the pan. Once hot, add about 1-2 tablespoons of batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swirl the pan to spread the batter into a thin layer. Cook the crepe until the edges are slightly hardened and bottom can be loosened with a spatula.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip and cook on the other side until a light golden-brown color is achieved.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat this process with all of the batter. Fill or top with your favorite fillings (we love them with keto nutella).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/RuledMe_AlmondFlourCrepes_9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve warm and enjoy! Feel free to add a few extra berries or powdered erythritol for some added aesthetic (just make sure you take any additions into account when calculating macros).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53485-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
